### Ödeme getir
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments/0fee40d0-d4e1-43ce-af56-9748733e834d


### Ödeme durumu — COMPLETED olmalı
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments/0fee40d0-d4e1-43ce-af56-9748733e834d

### Bakiye — 500 azalmış olmalı
GET http://localhost:8081/api/accounts/3519a8df-3162-40ce-a66c-e570b571a29e/balance